SM-T715 tablet: no do-not-disturb poll, no modem or call watcher.

The home toggles watch the notification service's state files instead of a
`qs ipc` call every 30 s, and the bar starts its modem and call watchers
only when the bar's cellWatch / callWatch setting is true (true in
tablet-shell.json, default off; in 0.2.147 cellWatchEnabled gates upstream's
new showCell so bar.statusIcons.cell continues to work on top of it, and
callWatch follows the same non-bound lifecycle); the idle block a profile
without one gets is the tablet's (both timers 0). The owner's Lenovomarchy
port's 0003-tablet-quiet-pollers, reworded (the SM-T715's 0.2.94 series had
the first two parts). Against omarchy-mobile 8991845 (omamobile-shell
0.2.147), after 0001-0002.

